DELETE /repos/{owner}/{repo}/actions/runs/{run_id}
Deletes a specific workflow run. Anyone with write access to the repository can use this endpoint. If the repository is private, OAuth tokens and personal access tokens (classic) need the `repo` scope to use this endpoint.
Required: owner (path) — The account owner of the repository. The name is not case sensitive.; repo (path) — The name of the repository without the `.git` extension. The name is not case sensitive.; run_id (path) — The unique identifier of the workflow run.
